      "description": "Concept of Sea Floor Spreading – Distribution of Ocean and Continents | Class 11 Geography | NCERT | Final Attempt\n\n📲 Connect with Final Attempt\n🎯Telegram: https://t.me/finalattemptofficial\n🎯Instagram: https://instagram.com/finalattempt_official\n🎯YouTube: https://youtube.com/@FinalAttemptOfficial\n🎯Website: https://finalattemptias.com\n\n📚 Concept of Sea Floor Spreading is one of the most important topics from NCERT Class 11 Geography and forms the foundation for understanding Plate Tectonics, Continental Drift Theory, and the Distribution of Oceans and Continents.\n\nIn this lecture, we explain the complete concept in a simple and exam-oriented manner, making it highly useful for UPSC, BPSC, State PCS, SSC, CUET, and other competitive examinations.\n\n📌 In this video, you will learn:\n\n✔ What is Sea Floor Spreading?\n✔ Evidence of Sea Floor Spreading\n✔ Mid-Oceanic Ridges\n✔ Formation of New Oceanic Crust\n✔ Role of Convection Currents\n✔ Harry Hess Theory\n✔ Magnetic Stripes & Paleomagnetism\n✔ Distribution of Oceans and Continents\n✔ Connection with Plate Tectonic Theory\n✔ NCERT Class 11 Geography Concepts\n✔ UPSC & BPSC Important Points\n\nThis lecture is specially designed to help aspirants build strong conceptual clarity for Geography and improve their preparation for both prelims and mains.\n\n🎯 Useful For:\n\nUPSC CSE\nBPSC\nState PCS\nSSC CGL & CHSL\nCUET\nUniversity Exams\nNCERT Class 11 Students\n\n📖 Subject: Geography\n📘 Book: NCERT Class 11 Geography\n📍 Chapter: Distribution of Oceans and Continents\n🎓 Topic: Concept of Sea Floor Spreading\n\n🔔 Subscribe to Final Attempt for quality Geography lectures, NCERT series, Current Affairs, Bihar Special content, PYQs, and complete preparation for BPSC & UPSC.\n\n👍 If you found this lecture helpful, don't forget to Like, Share, Comment, and Subscribe.\n\n#SeaFloorSpreading #DistributionOfOceansAndContinents #Class11Geography #NCERTGeography #Geography #HarryHess #PlateTectonics #Con